### Pediatric Brain Tumor {#pediatric-brain-tumor}









**1,731 of 2,792 patients** in the [pediatric brain tumor cohort](brain_tumor_cohort.qmd) have at least one Neural Frame registry case. This counts distinct patients with a registry diagnosis at any site or date; it is not a count of registry-confirmed pediatric brain tumors.

#### Registry case status

A patient counts once per status and may appear in more than one row. Percentages use the full pediatric cohort, including patients without a registry case.




